{"id":"decision-example-001","type":"decision","fact":"Example: Chose Zustand over Redux for client state management because of simpler API and smaller bundle size.","recommendation":"Use Zustand stores for client state. Use TanStack Query for server state. Do not mix the two patterns.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"Architecture decision","date":"2026-01-09"}],"tags":["architecture","state-management","zustand"],"affectedFiles":["src/stores/**/*.ts"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"decision-validation-layers-001","type":"decision","fact":"Two distinct validation layers apply to provider selection: (1) Pydantic Literal types reject unknown values at schema parse time (HTTP 422), (2) plugin_registry raises ValueError for values that are syntactically valid but unavailable at runtime (HTTP 400 via exception handler).","recommendation":"Use Literal['athena','postgres'] etc. on request schemas for closed-set enforcement. Use ValueError in registry factory functions for runtime unavailability. Map ValueError to 400 in main.py exception handler. Never conflate the two layers.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"feature/004-provider-selection session","date":"2026-06-17"}],"tags":["fastapi","pydantic","validation","error-handling","python"],"affectedFiles":["backend/models/schemas.py","backend/plugin_registry.py","backend/main.py"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"decision-providers-localfile-001","type":"decision","fact":"describe_providers() translates the internal local_file data_source_provider setting to athena when building ProvidersResponse, because local_file is a dev-only mode invisible to API consumers.","recommendation":"In describe_providers(), apply: effective_ds = settings.data_source_provider; if effective_ds == local_file: effective_ds = athena. Never expose local_file to API consumers.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"feature/004-provider-selection session","date":"2026-06-17"}],"tags":["plugin-registry","providers","api-design","python"],"affectedFiles":["backend/plugin_registry.py","backend/routers/analysis.py"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
